@startuml
title Glow Live v1 架構圖 - OBS + RTMP + NMS + HLS

actor Streamer as S
participant "OBS (RTMP Client)" as OBS
participant "Node-Media-Server (RTMP/HLS)" as NMS
database "NMS .ts / .m3u8" as Storage
actor Viewer as V
participant "HLS.js Player\n(<video>)" as HLS

== 推流階段 ==
S -> OBS: 啟動直播
OBS -> NMS: RTMP 推流（H.264 + AAC）

== 中轉處理階段 ==
NMS -> Storage: 儲存成 .ts 檔 & m3u8 playlist

== 播放階段 ==
V -> HLS: 請求 m3u8
HLS -> Storage: 請求 .ts chunks
Storage -> HLS: 回傳影片資料
HLS -> V: 顯示影片畫面（延遲約 2～5 秒）

@enduml